# Hand-written PDBx/mmCIF, not an archive entry.
#
# What it demonstrates: `pdbx_PDB_model_num` states two models, and an NMR ensemble is a set of
# alternative structures rather than one structure with its atoms duplicated -- so the reader must
# yield two records, each holding its own model's atoms and its own copy of the stated bonds.
